• tests/ui/union/field_checks.rs

• tests/ui/union/issue-41073.rs

• tests/ui/union/issue-81199.rs

• tests/ui/union/union-with-drop-fields.rs

Union field types are restricted to the following subset of types:

[items.union.field-copy]

 Tests

