    assert_eq!(NonZero::<i32>::from_ascii_bytes_radix(b"A", 16), Ok(NonZero::new(10)?));

Trailing space returns error:

    #![feature(int_from_ascii)]

    assert!(NonZero::<i32>::from_ascii_bytes_radix(b"1 ", 10).is_err());

